====== D-Link DIR-810L ======

The DIR-810L AC750 Wireless Dual-Band Router uses the MT7620A SoC, with 802.11bgn (SoC-integrated) and 802.11ac (on-board) radios.

OEM source code is available by searching for ''810L'' at: [[https://tsd.dlink.com.tw/dlist?OS=GPL]]

{{media:dlink:dir-810l:dir-810l_front.jpg?0x300|D-Link DIR-810L (front view)}}

The board is similar to [[:toh:trendnet:tew-810dr_1.0_1.1|TRENDnet TEW-810DR]]

